# MeWorld study mode (agents)

**Canonical doc:** `game/docs/STUDY_MODE.md`

## Which folder?

| Steve signal | Edit only |
|--------------|-----------|
| `START-MEWORLD-STUDY.bat`, `MeWorld-study`, "study mode", "while I'm studying" | `C:\Users\steve\MeWorld-study\game` |
| Feature dev, git commit, `npm run dev` on main | `C:\Users\steve\MeWorld\game` |
| "Port to main" / "sync main" | Copy study changes → main, commit main |

## Never

- Edit **both** `MeWorld` and `MeWorld-study` in one task without Steve asking
- Run `create-study-snapshot.ps1` mid-study (overwrites study code)
- Assume study and main are the same level — they **diverge**

## Chat history paths

- Disk: `user-data/cases/NNN.json` → `chatHistory`
- Browser: localStorage `schoonmaker_case_chat_history`
- List script: `node scripts/list-chat-histories.mjs`

## After code edits

`graphify update .` from `C:\Users\steve\MeWorld` (main) or teleprompter-station (recording repo).
